Now considering all these conversations here were some arguments why one might hold "Lean Agree" stance initially; 

Science provides facts and evidence-based truth which challenges long-held misconceptions or ignorance (as evident in various tweets). This could imply changing pre-existing notions on rights and wrongs based on scientific findings rather than opinions. The breaking-down aspect doesn't necessarily equate into disintegration but more towards restructuring perceptions aligned with empirical realities.
